  "question": {
    "text": "The frequency of a car horn encountered a change from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>. When the car approaches a vertical wall. If the speed of sound is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>330</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Then the speed of car is ___&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>."
  },
