  "correct_answer": "132",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0070_5fabb0933419.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 180px;\" /></p><p>Wall as an observer<br />Frequency received by wall,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br />Again wall as a source<br />Frequency received by observer on car,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>C</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>330</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>330</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>132</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
